<title>HONG KONG: Bank Austria sets HK$65 mln fixed rate CD.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria sets HK$65 mln fixed rate CD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Tokyo-Mitsubishi International (HK).</p>
<p> BORROWER  BANK AUSTRIA AG, HONG KONG BRANCH</p>
<p> AMOUNT    HK$65 MLN   COUPON     8.12 PCT   MATURITY  01.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE  FIXED RATE CD   ISS PRICE  PAR	  LAUNCH    17.APR.97</p>
<p> PUTS	NONE	  CALLS	YR 5	 REPAYMENT BULLET</p>
<p> GOV LAW   HONG KONG   HOME CTRY  AUSTRIA    DENOMS    HK$500K</p>
<p> PAY DATE  01.MAY.97   PAY FREQ   QUARTERLY</p>
<p> SOLE ARRANGER   TOKYO-MITSUBISHI INTERNATIONAL (HK)</p>
<p> NOTES     CLEARING THROUGH HONG KONG MONETARY AUTHORITY CENTRAL</p>
<p>	     MONEYMARKETS UNIT</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
